# Design system (garmonica)

Full guide: `DESIGN.md`. Source of tokens: `app/static/css/base/root.css`.

## Headings

- H1/H2 sections use `var(--font-headline)` (Montserrat), never Manrope.
- H1: `var(--font-size-h1)` + `var(--font-weight-h1)` (= 600).
- H2: `var(--font-size-h2)` + `var(--font-weight-h2)` (= 600).
- Do not use font-weight 300/400 on section titles.

## Colors

- Accent blue: `--color-accent` / `--color-accent-hover` / `--color-accent-light`.
- Urgent CTA: `--color-warm` via `.button--warm`.
- Text: `--color-text-dark` / `--color-text-muted`.
- No new brand colors without a `:root` variable.

## Buttons + icons

- Action buttons are always `.button--primary` (accent fill). Do not use `.button--outline` / `.button--ghost` as section CTAs.
- `.button--warm` only for urgent `tel:` CTA in hero/header — not for ordinary links.
- Every action button should include `<img class="button__icon" … width="16" height="16">`.
- UI icons: Phosphor from `app/static/icons/phosphor/` (usually 22×22 in cards, 16×16 in buttons).
- Brand favicons (reviews, messengers) stay outside Phosphor.
- Tint monochrome Phosphor `<img>` via selectors in `icons.css`.

## Section spacing

- Between blocks on service pages: only `margin-bottom: var(--section-fade)` (~36–56px).
- Do not stack `padding-block: var(--section-fade)` on a block that already follows another `--section-fade` margin (double gap).
- Match `.service-price` / `.service-payment` / `.service-diff` / `.reviews--service`.

## After CSS / JS edits

Bump `?v=` on `main.css` in `app/templates/base.html`. For JS modules without hash, hard-refresh or add `?v=` if caching bites.
